# (build 100b) Two Locustas: in the first one's attack its arm reaches up
# over the first group's name box. The box is a plane B window (bit 13 of
# its position word), and loc_978C writes a plane B window's frame with
# $500 -- no priority -- where a plane A one gets $8500; the enemies' own
# cells are plane A with no priority, so the arm is drawn over the box's
# border. Up to build 100b every frame cell had priority and the border
# covered the arm's tip. The pixel is the arm on the box's bottom border.
start battle 29
wait idle
press c
wait ticks 27
shot arm_over_box
expect pixel 106 33 $6C4
